“Before, I walked 3 km at dawn to fetch water and often missed lessons in school. Now, water is close to home, I arrive on time,” says Nyaluak Regina.
Through #SSHF funding, @WorldRelief_SSD is improving access to clean, safe water for communities in Leer County.
